{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114270","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1211427001:0":{"text":"落ち着けって。あんた賢そうなのに、本気であいつらが守ってくれると思ってたのか？","source_cn":"行了行了，我看你挺机灵的，应该不会傻到相信自己的笨蛋队友吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07326FDEA2C9CC27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211427002:0":{"text":"とっくに俺たちが倒したし、ついでにあんたの情報も吐かせたよ。","source_cn":"他们已经被干掉了，被干掉之前还顺手把你卖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69EBE810F71C8203","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211427003:1":{"text":"そいつらと同じ目に遭いたくなければ、分かってるよな？","source_cn":"你要是不想落个同样的下场，就乖乖听话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3736C407B66FF1DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211427004:1":{"text":"何が知りたい……？","source_cn":"你们想问什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2627F73F5C293112","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211427005:1":{"text":"お仲間から聞いたんだが、あの特殊な扉を開けられるんだって？","source_cn":"你的好队友说，你能打开那些特殊的门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8736816D342A4696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211427006:0":{"text":"ふふふ……そうだ、私なら開けられる。","source_cn":"呵呵呵……不错，我可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D6F248B2B45EB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211427007:0":{"text":"だがお前たちが突然入って来たせいで、驚いて鍵を釜に落としてしまった……今頃ドロドロに溶けているだろうな。","source_cn":"但是你们刚才突然闯过来攻击我，我一哆嗦，钥匙掉进坩埚里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C22CEB0C6769CD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211427008:0":{"text":"鍵が一つしかないなんて言わないよな？さっさと予備の鍵を出しな！","source_cn":"钥匙不可能只有一把，赶紧把备用钥匙交出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972F23793D023649","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211427009:1":{"text":"もちろんあるさ！だが予備の鍵は船長が持っている。","source_cn":"备用钥匙当然有，只不过，在船长手里。恐怕你们得去找他要了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F65B22354548A78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211427010:0":{"text":"てめぇ、痛い目見ねぇと――","source_cn":"我看 你是欠揍——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68B6F02644902728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211427011:0":{"text":"落ち着いてください、シンドバッドさん！ここはマスターにお任せを！","source_cn":"冷静，辛巴达！剩下的交给梅林吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9148D1793E4BEDB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"落ち着いてください、シンドバッドさん！ここはマスターにお任せを！","female":"落ち着いてください、シンドバッドさん！ここはマスターにお任せを！","variant_male_record_index":"132226","variant_female_record_index":"132227","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211427012:1":{"text":"鍵を元通りにするくらい、マスターにとっては朝飯前です！","source_cn":"重铸钥匙而已，这对梅林来说易如反掌！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8EAA91AA478FC455","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"鍵を元通りにするくらい、マスターにとっては朝飯前です！","female":"鍵を元通りにするくらい、マスターにとっては朝飯前です！","variant_male_record_index":"132228","variant_female_record_index":"132229","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"シンドバッド","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆怯的死潮法师":{"text":"臆病な錬金術師","source":"胆怯的死潮法师","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}